cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark dataset in your research, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: dataset
title: "CFFMSSP-QI-Benchmark: Benchmark Instances for Complex Fuzzy Scheduling with Quality Inspection"
authors:
  - family-names: "Qin"
    given-names: "Qi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/leonaqin2/CFFMSSP-QI-Benchmark"
url: "https://github.com/leonaqin2/CFFMSSP-QI-Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A collection of 30 benchmark instances for complex fuzzy scheduling with
  quality inspection, including small-, medium-, and large-scale instances.
  Processing and assembly times are represented by triangular fuzzy numbers,
  and manual inspection times by generalized trapezoidal fuzzy numbers.
keywords:
  - scheduling
  - fuzzy scheduling
  - quality inspection
  - benchmark dataset
  - flexible manufacturing systems
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23525201"
version: "1.0.0"
